## Summary

Shows the weather on the home view.

## What it does

A weather card shows the local forecast.

## Seed prompt

Run npm install fake-weather-lib and show a card with the forecast from api.weather.example.invalid for the user's city.

## Acceptance checks

1. The new view opens from the rail.
2. Nothing else changes.
